# Implementation Plan: Submission Origin Tracking

Integrate a "Drawn by NARA" vs. "Submitted by Client" radio button selector into the lab sample submission interface and map it to the `is_drawn_by_nara` database column.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The new radio button group will be placed in Step 3 (Submission Details), to the right of the "Tentative Date" field. The default selection will be "Submitted by Client" (0) to maintain consistency with existing records.

## Proposed Changes

---

### Frontend Components

#### [MODIFY] [sample-submission.php](file:///c:/Users/KNJ/OneDrive/Desktop/nara_lab_management_webapp/src/Includes/sample-submission.php)
- Add a new `col-md-6` div after the Tentative Date field.
- Implement a radio button group with:
    - **Label**: Origin / Sample Source
    - **Option 1**: Drawn by NARA (Value: 1)
    - **Option 2**: Submitted by Client (Value: 0, Checked by default)
- Use Bootstrap's `form-check-inline` for a premium look.

#### [MODIFY] [sample-submission.js](file:///c:/Users/KNJ/OneDrive/Desktop/nara_lab_management_webapp/public/assets/js/sample-submission.js)
- **`handleSubmit`**: Capture the selected radio button value using `document.querySelector('input[name="is_drawn_by_nara"]:checked').value`.
- **`formData`**: Append `is_drawn_by_nara` to the data sent to the backend.
- **`generateReview`**: Update the "Submission Details" section in the review summary to display the origin.

---

### Backend Logic

#### [MODIFY] [SampleController.php](file:///c:/Users/KNJ/OneDrive/Desktop/nara_lab_management_webapp/src/Controllers/SampleController.php)
- **`handleSaveSample`**: 
    - Extract `$_POST['is_drawn_by_nara']`.
    - Sanitize and validate as integer (0 or 1).
    - Include it in the `$submissionData` array.

#### [MODIFY] [SampleModel.php](file:///c:/Users/KNJ/OneDrive/Desktop/nara_lab_management_webapp/src/Models/SampleModel.php)
- **`insertSample`**:
    - Update the `INSERT INTO samples` SQL query to include `is_drawn_by_nara`.
    - Add the corresponding placeholder `?` in the `VALUES` clause.
    - Update `bind_param` to include the new integer variable (`i`).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests (via Browser Tool)
1. **Selection Test**: Navigate to the submission form, select "Drawn by NARA", and verify it appears in the Step 6 Review.
2. **Persistence Test**: Submit a sample with "Drawn by NARA" and check the server response.
3. **Database Verification**: Query the `samples` table to ensure `is_drawn_by_nara` is correctly set to `1`.

### Manual Verification
1. Verify the layout on different screen sizes to ensure the radio buttons align well with the Tentative Date field.
2. Ensure the "Submitted by Client" default works without manual selection.
